{"seq":22,"slug":"container-security","title":"容器安全","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"容器安全\">容器安全</h1><p>容器技术在过去十年彻底改变了软件交付方式，但它带来的安全挑战同样深刻。一个被攻破的容器镜像可能在数小时内扩散至数千个生产工作负载；一个配置错误的 Pod 可以让攻击者从单个容器跳转到整个集群的控制平面。容器安全不是一个单点问题，而是贯穿构建、分发、运行全生命周期的系统性工程。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于容器环境（Docker + Kubernetes）的安全加固与威胁防御实践。与同目录下的「容器化」hub 的分工界限在于：容器化 hub 关注如何正确地构建、编排和运维容器工作负载，本 hub 则专注于如何让这些工作负载免受攻击——从镜像构建阶段的漏洞扫描与供应链完整性验证，到运行时的行为检测与内核级强制隔离，再到编排层的准入策略与网络微分段。</p>\n<p>与「应用安全」类 hub（56_cybersecurity-applied）的区别在于：应用安全从攻防视角审视整个软件栈的漏洞与防护策略，而本 hub 深入容器这一特定运行环境的实操工具链（Trivy、Falco、Sigstore、Kyverno、eBPF 等），提供可直接落地到 CI/CD 流水线和 Kubernetes 集群的配置方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 Docker 和 Kubernetes 基础操作经验的工程师，建议按以下顺序推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>——理解容器环境特有的威胁模型、攻击面与纵深防御架构设计，建立安全思维框架</li>\n<li><strong>供应链篇</strong>——掌握镜像扫描（Trivy/Grype）、SBOM 生成与 VEX 漏洞消解、Sigstore 签名与 SLSA 构建溯源，守住&quot;左移&quot;安全关口</li>\n<li><strong>运行时篇</strong>——部署 Falco 进行行为异常检测，配置 Seccomp/AppArmor 内核级限制，利用 eBPF 实现深度安全可观测</li>\n<li><strong>编排篇</strong>——通过 Pod Security Standards 建立基线，用 Kyverno/OPA Gatekeeper 实施策略即代码，以 NetworkPolicy 实现集群内微隔离</li>\n</ol>\n<p>安全工程师或 SRE 可以从编排篇切入快速加固生产集群，然后补齐供应链与运行时的纵深；开发者可以先聚焦供应链篇，把安全内建到 CI/CD 流程中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>Docker 基础操作（Dockerfile 编写、镜像构建与推送、容器生命周期管理）</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 核心概念（Pod、Deployment、Namespace、RBAC、Service）</li>\n<li>Linux 基础（进程隔离、文件权限、namespace、cgroup 的基本概念）</li>\n<li>CI/CD 流水线基本概念（GitHub Actions 或类似平台的使用经验）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"容器安全基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-threat-model","title":"容器威胁模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/foundations/container-threat-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attack-surface-analysis","title":"容器攻击面分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/foundations/attack-surface-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"defense-in-depth","title":"容器纵深防御架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/foundations/defense-in-depth"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain","title":"容器供应链安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"image-scanning-trivy","title":"镜像漏洞扫描与 Trivy","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/image-scanning-trivy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sbom-and-vex","title":"SBOM 与 VEX 漏洞消解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/sbom-and-vex"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-and-provenance","title":"镜像签名与构建溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/signing-and-provenance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime","title":"容器运行时安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"falco-runtime-detection","title":"Falco 运行时威胁检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/falco-runtime-detection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seccomp-apparmor","title":"Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/seccomp-apparmor"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ebpf-observability","title":"eBPF 安全可观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/ebpf-observability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"orchestration","title":"容器编排安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pod-security-standards","title":"Pod Security Standards 安全基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/pod-security-standards"},{"seq":2,"slug":"admission-control-kyverno","title":"准入控制与 Kyverno","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/admission-control-kyverno"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-policies","title":"NetworkPolicy 微隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/network-policies"}]}]}